<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Félix Gallardo, the founder of the Guadalajara cartel, died at age 80 in prison, prompting police deployments around his hospital. The United States offered a $10 million reward for information on Mexican cartel money-laundering networks and added a new Latin American group to its foreign terrorist organization list, now totaling 22. Four gunmen, including two minors, were arrested in Mazatlán and weapons, motorcycles and a vehicle were seized. A terrorist cartel killed an innocent man in a bombing attack in Sinaloa, and domestic violence files in Puerto Vallarta rose 76 percent. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPSW45dWs2QlRad09FcDI3Zl9Mc2wzM3hFYlFZa0toWEJiMzI1R3BSNmV0a1pIbHk0T1JBbDhQMnplbkl0RzB2OXpCVmdFdnYyd3YwN1VkWnY3ai1OTC1jZVExcG5xeXJjVC1vYjlnc054eG1xQkd6U1VnU0dDcG1MbzRKT21hVW56aURKdWJWU3E3OHQxUTVlMXNPYm9PQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNWGtMVVZYeHRMTVBEMkM1T2x5M29fdGF5TC01RTJVQmJraXllU3pzV2toVVBQc2xQbFpXVEh5SGpOYzZabEVnNk9IbDhsNXAzVjA2bUJqQUZsY1o2R2d2enB0bHYyU21vclBBQmRXU2xrVEl2S19kX0xXbVNEZUlSNmpld2FjelZRQ05nUWgtZWV5UG1XOWlHWFZ1bUpkb04wQmMw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQWWg2OEt4aWcyZzV3YUF3MHBqNVpkR1lRRWVOc1drcElyZHpUay1FUnU5dFhybzhsM1lkb3dhNVZtalRHUDI2T0lmTVo1djcwVUktU2lyMmxnLURWdjRFMzdiSUVmZG5FVGVRSjA5Q2gyVWVUdF85SC1mSlk1anpxSFAxV1lOakt2dmo5R2pHSjZnclZkNzcwR1BYVHN1VzdiNW1aMldMcm9fVmNMX3ZrWTdVeFZwMnlLSTgtVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxNY29WcGJGZUJhRk15RWV6MDE1d3VKVi1hdGRsU0o5elBoejNDTUxaUzhNRVZhYzM2dHFqRVZwQ3RXUjJIaUJHcVlRaGx4V1FsNElVY2pZUkhaY0FHaW01bkxPX3JxVUw4TzgzQ